1
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,880
Why are you kneeling?

2
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,480
I'm sorry.

3
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,450
I'll take responsibility.

4
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,940
Take responsibility?

5
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,759
A sick mom, a runaway dad,

6
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:39,200
a rebellious sister,

7
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:43,840
plus this rundown house.

8
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,060
How can you take responsibility?

9
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,400
I'm sorry.

10
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,759
It was consensual.

11
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,940
I don't need you to take responsibility.

12
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,080
By the way,

13
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,840
come with me somewhere.

14
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:04,360
No matter what I say or do then,

15
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,960
just say yes.

16
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,160
Got it?

17
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,039
Where to?

18
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,040
It's time.

19
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,570
Why hasn't anyone shown up?

20
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,360
Yingying,

21
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:27,860
did you write the wrong date
on the invitations?

22
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,040
I don't think so.

23
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,600
I'll call and ask.

24
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,840
Don't bother.

25
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,079
No one is coming today.

26
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:35,800
What have you done this time?

27
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,040
How could I, Dad?

28
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,440
One of you is my father,

29
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:39,920
and the other is my best friend.

30
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:42,160
I'm happier than anyone
about your engagement.

31
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:44,480
You both say you've found true love.

32
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:46,720
I was deeply inspired and really envious.

33
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,440
See,

34
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,320
I found my true love too.

35
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,040
Shanchuan,

36
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,360
Darling,

37
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,160
am I your true love?

38
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,280
When did this guy get mixed up in this?

39
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,880
You know bachelor number two here?

40
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,600
He's my friend.

41
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,640
You know

42
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,520
he's exactly my type.

43
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,120
Rongrong,

44
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,880
You can't seduce my brother

45
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,240
just to get back at me.

46
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,480
Seduce?

47
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,800
Don't make it sound so ugly.

48
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,040
We fell in love at first sight.

49
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,320
It's true love.

50
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,440
Rongrong,

51
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,600
I'm begging you.

52
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,000
Don't hurt my family.

53
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,880
Let my love go, please.

54
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:39,840
I'm begging you.

55
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,120
Don't pull me. Don't hurt my love.

56
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,680
Get up. Rongrong, get up.

57
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,840
Don't pull me.

58
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,040
Yingying,

59
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:46,960
are you okay?

60
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:52,120
Rongrong,

61
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,960
she's pregnant with your brother.

62
00:03:55,079 --> 00:03:56,560
Are you trying to kill him?

63
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:01,160
I'm teaching my daughter a lesson.

64
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,560
Outsiders stay out of it.

65
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,840
Yue Yingying fell on her own.

66
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,480
I saw it clearly.

67
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,880
Brother, what are you saying?

68
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:11,600
How can you help an outsider?

69
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,530
What are you talking about?

70
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,839
I'm my mom's only daughter.

71
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,519
Where would I get a brother?

72
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,200
Take a good look.

73
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:25,960
Your beloved son is gone.

74
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:34,420
How could this happen?

75
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,760
Yingying,

76
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,760
tell me what's going on.

77
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:45,680
Since when did you know?

78
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,720
Actually, logically speaking,

79
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,400
this has nothing to do with me.

80
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,080
Don't cause trouble or make a scene.

81
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,080
Stay neutral.

82
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:59,620
Don't get involved
in other people's karma.

83
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,480
Yun Qingqing,

84
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:07,960
how can you be so numb and indifferent?

85
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,200
If you just stand by and watch today,

86
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,360
no one will cheer for you

87
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,840
when you're in trouble.

88
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:18,160
But have you forgotten
how much you suffered

89
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,480
and how many times you took the blame

90
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,600
for being nosy?

91
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,620
Whatever, I'll just do it.

92
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,160
It's getting late. What do you want?

93
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,200
Let me state first,

94
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,560
I'm just stating facts,

95
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,400
not expressing any opinions,

96
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,480
and it has no legal effect.

97
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,680
I don't want to cause trouble
or make a scene.

98
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,840
Whatever you do after knowing this

99
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:37,240
has nothing to do with me.

100
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,840
I've signed your disclaimer.

101
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,240
So what do you want to say?

102
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,960
I just wanted to ask

103
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:46,120
if Ms. Shu is on her period.

104
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:47,360
If so,

105
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,280
we can provide you with

106
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,320
free sanitary products.

107
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,320
I don't need them.

108
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,920
I'm the only one at Yunbian right now.

109
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,080
I have to be both the manager
and the cleaner.

110
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,440
So when I was taking out the trash today,

111
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,120
I found a used sanitary pad.

112
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,440
After all, including me,

113
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:06,800
there are only three girls in the shop.

114
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:10,480
But it's not my time of the month yet.

115
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:16,920
Yue Yingying really has her ways.

116
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,200
Thank you.

117
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,770
I'll look into this matter.

118
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,010
I'm just stating the facts.

119
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,540
I don't know anything.

120
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,130
Get some rest, Miss Shu.

121
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,260
Why are you helping me?

122
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:29,760
I'm not helping you.

123
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,080
We at Yunbianshang

124
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,880
never leak our guests' privacy.

125
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,640
Good night, Miss Shu.

126
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:42,280
Nice assist.

127
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:43,800
Just average.

128
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:47,000
I'm just a bit chaotic good.

129
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,890
My mom doesn't know about this yet.

130
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,320
If I wasn't afraid of breaking her heart
by making a scene,

131
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,360
I wouldn't have bothered
stopping the guests.

132
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,760
What a great opportunity

133
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,159
to let your friends see

134
00:06:58,159 --> 00:07:00,080
your hypocritical love.

135
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,520
Rongrong, I'm sorry.

136
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,800
I was just confused for a moment.

137
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,680
You're not confused.

138
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:09,920
You're just scheming

139
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,840
against the Shu family.

140
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:14,680
You enjoy everything
the Shu family brings you,

141
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,560
but you can't let go of

142
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,320
your pathetic male ego.

143
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,280
You married into the family
but you're still not satisfied,

144
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,720
and you still want to play
the patriarchal game.

145
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,050
Aren't you ridiculous?

146
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:24,080
Do you love her?

147
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:27,320
You love her belly.

148
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:28,680
And you,

149
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,640
you keep saying
you're not after the money,

150
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,960
but everything you do is for money.

151
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,240
Manager Yun,

152
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,860
she's calling you.

153
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,640
How much does it cost
for them to book Yunbianshang

154
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,400
and set up this venue?

155
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,120
50,000.

156
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,540
How much did you quote him?

157
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,720
Three hundred thousand.

158
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,050
Five hundred thousand.

159
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,330
What are you talking about?

160
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,880
Are you in this with her?

161
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,240
No.

162
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:05,440
The payment details are crystal clear.

163
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,840
Want me to show you?

164
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:07,480
Yeah,

165
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,340
we have the transaction records.

166
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,040
Enough, Yue Yingying.

167
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:14,320
You lost your baby two months ago.

168
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,000
You know that without the baby,

169
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,160
you're nothing to my dad.

170
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,400
So you wanted to take this chance

171
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:21,560
to frame me for your miscarriage.

172
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:24,720
That way, my dad would feel guilty,

173
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:27,180
and you could milk him for more money.

174
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,360
You're smart,

175
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,820
but you're using it the wrong way.

176
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,440
Look at what you've become.

177
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,320
Have you thrown away your dignity
and conscience just for money?

178
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,720
How much are dignity and conscience worth?

179
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,760
Who in this world
doesn't want a good life?

180
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,290
Who doesn't love money?

181
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,890
Stop pretending to be above it all.

182
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,080
Broke but still acting high and mighty.

183
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:52,480
You deserve to rot
in a rental room forever.

184
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,180
You treat money like dirt, right?

185
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:58,120
That's because
you were born with everything.

186
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,600
It's easy for you to say.

187
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,600
Hypocrite.

188
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,760
And you,

189
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,680
tell me the truth.

190
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,960
How exactly did I lose my son?

191
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,360
Old man,

192
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,120
look at your age.

193
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,600
With such poor sperm quality,

194
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,860
no one could have kept your precious son.

195
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,480
What we had

196
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:23,210
was nothing but a transaction.

197
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,320
I traded my youth for your money,

198
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:27,960
and you paid me to bear you a child.

199
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:29,480
Too bad

200
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,320
this deal fell through.

201
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,440
I've lost now.

202
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,720
So you can

203
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:38,000
take the moral high ground to accuse

204
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,440
and judge me.

205
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,080
But what if I won?

206
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:45,130
You would only praise my business acumen.

207
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,880
This world

208
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,600
only judges by success or failure.

209
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,240
Excuse me, everyone.

210
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,960
My next business deal is here.

211
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,730
No need to see me off.

212
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,360
My cab will be here soon.

213
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,700
Even though I'm just the acting manager,

214
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,960
I can't skip any of the services.

215
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,410
You're quite a contradiction.

216
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,720
You seem brave,

217
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:33,940
but you're afraid of trouble.

218
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:37,000
You look slick,
but you're not worldly enough.

219
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,080
You seem aloof deep down,

220
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:42,410
but you compromise in reality.

221
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:45,160
You live such a conflicted life.

222
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:49,120
Isn't everyone like this nowadays?

223
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:50,820
Being conflicted is the norm.

224
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:53,340
What I hate most is this kind of conflict.

225
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:56,640
The reason ordinary people like you
resent me is that

226
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:57,480
you can only

227
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:59,720
use these moral standards to judge me,

228
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,920
so you can comfort yourselves.

229
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,800
Once you have money,

230
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,200
you'd wish everyone in the world

231
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,400
were a gold digger.

232
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:08,520
Money is important.

233
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:12,720
But is it really worth it

234
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:16,080
to objectify yourself for money
and put a price tag

235
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,410
on everything you have?

236
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:20,120
Putting a price tag on things isn't scary.

237
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:20,960
What's scary is

238
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,200
working like a dog
for someone your whole life

239
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,000
and ending up with nothing.

240
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:26,040
It's really ridiculous.

241
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,280
Alright,

242
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,440
I should go.

243
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,320
You should think about it too.

244
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,120
Thank you.

245
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:12,360
Maybe she's right.

246
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,160
This is just

247
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,850
how the world works.

248
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,680
Playing dead again?

249
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,040
I told you,

250
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,490
no dying on my watch.

251
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:29,720
Don't worry.

252
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,240
I'll find another spot.

253
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,040
What Yue Yingying said today

254
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,100
was pure bullshit.

255
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:46,210
Don't you ever empathize
with those weirdos.

256
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,440
What they do best

257
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,840
is make excuses and sugarcoat themselves.

258
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:51,000
I know.

259
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:52,480
I understand.

260
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:55,610
A gentleman makes money the right way.

261
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:59,120
Every penny earned through hard work

262
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,680
should be clean

263
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,160
and guilt-free.

264
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:08,880
The money I make

265
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:11,800
is honest.

266
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:15,800
And no one can point fingers at me.

267
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:21,000
But why

268
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,520
am I still in so much pain?

269
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:29,560
Sometimes,

270
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:32,690
I really just want to end it all.

271
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,800
Close my eyes

272
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,040
and let it all go.

273
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:52,120
Actually, you don't want to end your life.

274
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,290
You want to end the pain.

275
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,400
Right?

276
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:11,400
Let's go.

277
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:13,180
I'm making Maihua soup today.

278
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,690
Can you leave out the cilantro?

279
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:22,120
There's no cilantro in Maihua soup anyway.

280
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:35,760
I'm really sorry.

281
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,040
My sister doesn't know any better.

282
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:38,300
Sorry for the trouble.

283
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,090
It's fine. It's not your fault.

284
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:43,640
You've got quite the work experience.

285
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:46,040
Not only do you do part-time logistics
at Yunbian,

286
